; Sprite: Willy facing right, walk frame 2
;
; One 16x16 sprite of 32 bytes: 16 pixel rows of 2 bytes (left byte, right byte; bit 7 = leftmost pixel), drawn with
; #R$9456. Willy walking to the right (observed: key P gives $85D0 = 2, bit 0 clear), walk frame 2. #R$9637 draws Willy
; from $9D00 + 128*(bit 0 of #R$85D0) + 32*(#R$85D2 AND 3); the lives indicator #R$898B shows frames 0-3 in turn (frame
; counter #R$85E1); the game-over sequence #R$8B07 draws this frame at $488F as the figure that the foot falls on.
@label=SpriteWillyRight2
b$9D40 DEFB $03,$C0
 $9D42 DEFB $03,$C0
 $9D44 DEFB $07,$E0
 $9D46 DEFB $03,$40
 $9D48 DEFB $03,$E0
 $9D4A DEFB $03,$C0
 $9D4C DEFB $01,$80
 $9D4E DEFB $03,$C0
 $9D50 DEFB $07,$E0
 $9D52 DEFB $07,$E0
 $9D54 DEFB $0F,$70
 $9D56 DEFB $0F,$B0
 $9D58 DEFB $03,$C0
 $9D5A DEFB $07,$60
 $9D5C DEFB $06,$E0
